{"id":"n83568-1-7","stage":2,"title":"푸다 · 盛","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83568-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 나와서 저녁 준비 좀 도와주겠니?","zh":"智秀啊，出来帮我准备一下晚餐好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"나와서","meaning":"出，走出","explanation":"나오다：出，走出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"13","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와서","audio":"/audio/0fa3938955583182ca19.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}},{"text":"준비","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"도와주겠니?","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":